==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-B Vol. 6 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Slowpoke Drop Event]], which ran from April 9 to 19, 2026.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Platinum|Electrike|74}} from the {{TCG|Platinum}} expansion.
*'''Reckless Charge''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Movie VS Pack|Ash's Phanpy|4}} from the {{TCG|Movie Commemoration VS Pack: Aura's Lucario}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

